    "order": 127,
    "anchor": "achieving-secondary-missions-3",
    "summary": "As each player's turn ends, both players do this, the active player first:\n\n1. For each Secondary Mission whose conditions you met, you can score the VP it lists. With Tactical Secondary Missions, discard each card you score this way; it is achieved.\n2. On your own turn only, with Tactical Secondary Missions, you may discard at least 1 active Secondary Mission to gain 1 CP.",
